  "remarks": "Sources agree on verse G F C G and chorus G D C G (one writes C7, D7). Charted at sounding pitch; one lesson has the record tuned a whole step down, played with A shapes. The break is G in two sources; two others show a G, Gdim, C, G figure. Eight-bar intro and break and the fade are fitted to 133 BPM and 2:20.",
